(176523, 10053, 1647, '<td valign="top">A lovely bright cheery photo...  And it meets the challenge theme.  Did you custom print the background or was it something you had handy?  Great photo.</td>', 'A lovely bright cheery photo...  And it meets the challenge theme.  Did you custom print the background or was it something you had handy?  Great photo.', '2002-12-23 00:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
