(176536, 10030, 1647, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting, exposure and framing.  Lighting clear perspex indicates that you know your stuff and have good equipment.  Nice photo.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting, exposure and framing.  Lighting clear perspex indicates that you know your stuff and have good equipment.  Nice photo.', '2002-12-23 00:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
