(176539, 9896, 1647, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little bit dark.  Everything looks a little bit yellow and uninviting to eat.  Perhaps try a cheap halogen floodlight to throw some white light onto the subject.</td>', 'Perhaps a little bit dark.  Everything looks a little bit yellow and uninviting to eat.  Perhaps try a cheap halogen floodlight to throw some white light onto the subject.', '2002-12-23 00:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
