(176633, 9904, 4648, '<td valign="top">Everything inside of me wants to give you a 10 for what you are saying, but I can''t.  I wish all 4 had been in focus.  As it is the only thing really in focus is the flag.  Maybe you should have set out 4 flags.  I love the snow, the composition, the thought expressed but the best I can give it because of the focus is 4.  I hate that, too.  PTL</td>', 'Everything inside of me wants to give you a 10 for what you are saying, but I can''t.  I wish all 4 had been in focus.  As it is the only thing really in focus is the flag.  Maybe you should have set out 4 flags.  I love the snow, the composition, the thought expressed but the best I can give it because of the focus is 4.  I hate that, too.  PTL', '2002-12-23 01:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(176636, 10076, 5759, '<td valign="top">4 clean feet at least... and no corns</td>', '4 clean feet at least... and no corns', '2002-12-23 01:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(176637, 10010, 5759, '<td valign="top">or a one way ticket to the grave</td>', 'or a one way ticket to the grave', '2002-12-23 01:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(176638, 10048, 3273, '<td valign="top">It''s a little too tightly cropped at the top and bottom.  I''d prefer to see the outline of the darker dice rather than just the dots.  It would have been better to use four dice rather than a mirror.  It''s still a nice photo though!!</td>', 'It''s a little too tightly cropped at the top and bottom.  I''d prefer to see the outline of the darker dice rather than just the dots.  It would have been better to use four dice rather than a mirror.  It''s still a nice photo though!!', '2002-12-23 01:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(176640, 9963, 4648, '<td valign="top">This photo is beautiful.  Great colors, beautiful sky, love the trees, the texture of the building, the angle of the shot, the focus is right on.  The crop is the weakest feature, but then that''s just my opinion.  I would like to have seen more of the structure, but I realize you would have had more windows...so.  Please let me see a shot of the whole house.  This is a 10 in my book.  PTL</td>', 'This photo is beautiful.  Great colors, beautiful sky, love the trees, the texture of the building, the angle of the shot, the focus is right on.  The crop is the weakest feature, but then that''s just my opinion.  I would like to have seen more of the structure, but I realize you would have had more windows...so.  Please let me see a shot of the whole house.  This is a 10 in my book.  PTL', '2002-12-23 01:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(176645, 9955, 4648, '<td valign="top">How did you ever get them to do this, or stay this way long enough to get a sharp picture.  This is so good.  I love it.  Had trouble finding the 4th, then found his head and the other ones on top of it.  For a minute I thought they were one.  Great shot.  You captured their color fantastically.  I like everything about this.  It''s a 10.  PTL</td>', 'How did you ever get them to do this, or stay this way long enough to get a sharp picture.  This is so good.  I love it.  Had trouble finding the 4th, then found his head and the other ones on top of it.  For a minute I thought they were one.  Great shot.  You captured their color fantastically.  I like everything about this.  It''s a 10.  PTL', '2002-12-23 01:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
