(176660, 10059, 4648, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what your title means or what this photo means.  What I do know is that the longer I lok at the 4 little holes the bigger the white spots around them get.<br/>I see 4 distinct color changes from the outer edge to the 4 holes.  I don''t like modern art and that is what this looks like......BUT I like this - now.  It grows on you.  Maybe I ought to wait awhile to score it, til it grows to a 10.  This is crazy but I like it more and more.  Right now it''s up to a 7 from my initial 2.  PTL</td>', 'I have no idea what your title means or what this photo means.  What I do know is that the longer I lok at the 4 little holes the bigger the white spots around them get.I see 4 distinct color changes from the outer edge to the 4 holes.  I don''t like modern art and that is what this looks like......BUT I like this - now.  It grows on you.  Maybe I ought to wait awhile to score it, til it grows to a 10.  This is crazy but I like it more and more.  Right now it''s up to a 7 from my initial 2.  PTL', '2002-12-23 01:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
