(177251, 9975, 4811, '<td valign="top">Very moody. Original interpretation of challenge. Excellent quality of sky/fog, and I think having the photo exposed for the sky, with a darkened windmill, an excellent choice. Square framing is nice, wonder if there was a way to frame/crop the photo so that the entire windmill was in the shot, though stands alone well like this! Great shot!</td>', 'Very moody. Original interpretation of challenge. Excellent quality of sky/fog, and I think having the photo exposed for the sky, with a darkened windmill, an excellent choice. Square framing is nice, wonder if there was a way to frame/crop the photo so that the entire windmill was in the shot, though stands alone well like this! Great shot!', '2002-12-23 18:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(177252, 9990, 4906, '<td valign="top">I think this would have worked better with a different backdrop and more subtle lighting.</td>', 'I think this would have worked better with a different backdrop and more subtle lighting.', '2002-12-23 18:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
