(177254, 9924, 4811, '<td valign="top">Love the different textures and justposition of the railing and tile''s blue clors to the muted earth tones of the building. Nicely composed, with all the lines in the photo all diaganal, and interesecting at right angles. Though you needed the sign to fit the challenge, it seems out of place in the abstract though and the shot (outside of the dpchallenge context) would have been probably nicer without the sign. One of my favorites this week.</td>', 'Love the different textures and justposition of the railing and tile''s blue clors to the muted earth tones of the building. Nicely composed, with all the lines in the photo all diaganal, and interesecting at right angles. Though you needed the sign to fit the challenge, it seems out of place in the abstract though and the shot (outside of the dpchallenge context) would have been probably nicer without the sign. One of my favorites this week.', '2002-12-23 18:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(177257, 10053, 4811, '<td valign="top">Very artistic and interesting composition. Love the colors and symmetry of the shot! The glare in the glass is somewhat distracting but I have a hard time myself removing these from my own photographs.</td>', 'Very artistic and interesting composition. Love the colors and symmetry of the shot! The glare in the glass is somewhat distracting but I have a hard time myself removing these from my own photographs.', '2002-12-23 18:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
