(177281, 9995, 4811, '<td valign="top">As for meeting the challenge, I don''t feel it meets it as strongly as it should - one fish is hard to see - but otherwise the elements of the photo make a very interesting abstract, especially the colored bits on the top left. Looks a little messy with the grass, perhaps a composition where the grass is less cluttered would have worked better.</td>', 'As for meeting the challenge, I don''t feel it meets it as strongly as it should - one fish is hard to see - but otherwise the elements of the photo make a very interesting abstract, especially the colored bits on the top left. Looks a little messy with the grass, perhaps a composition where the grass is less cluttered would have worked better.', '2002-12-23 19:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(177283, 9929, 4811, '<td valign="top">Very neat abstract, almost seems like jellyfish at the bottom of a deep ocean :) jpg could have been at a better quality, or perhaps the artifacts are a product of oversharpening? Can''t tell the difference yet... nice shot!</td>', 'Very neat abstract, almost seems like jellyfish at the bottom of a deep ocean :) jpg could have been at a better quality, or perhaps the artifacts are a product of oversharpening? Can''t tell the difference yet... nice shot!', '2002-12-23 19:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
