(177417, 9838, 4648, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but it''s a little dark for me.  Then I don''t know what you went through to get this.  But I do hope you tell us.  The focus is a little too soft for me - can''t really distringuish the letters on the camera, but not bad on the faces.  A little red on the faces.  Still not a bad shot.  6 is respectable.  PTL</td>', 'I like the composition but it''s a little dark for me.  Then I don''t know what you went through to get this.  But I do hope you tell us.  The focus is a little too soft for me - can''t really distringuish the letters on the camera, but not bad on the faces.  A little red on the faces.  Still not a bad shot.  6 is respectable.  PTL', '2002-12-24 00:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
