(177423, 10044, 4648, '<td valign="top">Glad you didn''t say they were racing.  This is a quality shot, sure is dirty water, but there seems to be something missing when I look at it.  Maybe a closer shot so we could see the people better?  I like the reflections in the water and the bank on the side.  I also like the cropping of the bank, showing how high it is.  Wish I could pinpoint what is missing.  Right now it''s a 6.  PTL  If I figure it out I''ll update my comment.</td>', 'Glad you didn''t say they were racing.  This is a quality shot, sure is dirty water, but there seems to be something missing when I look at it.  Maybe a closer shot so we could see the people better?  I like the reflections in the water and the bank on the side.  I also like the cropping of the bank, showing how high it is.  Wish I could pinpoint what is missing.  Right now it''s a 6.  PTL  If I figure it out I''ll update my comment.', '2002-12-24 00:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(177424, 9998, 4648, '<td valign="top">Something wrong with me.  The table seems to be going downhill toward the right.  It makes me feel like leaning to veiw the picture.  Otherwise it''s a good picture.  It''s still a 6.  PTL</td>', 'Something wrong with me.  The table seems to be going downhill toward the right.  It makes me feel like leaning to veiw the picture.  Otherwise it''s a good picture.  It''s still a 6.  PTL', '2002-12-24 00:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(177426, 10073, 4648, '<td valign="top">Too out of focus and I question if they are really candy canes.  Home made?  Maybe.  Sorry but all I can give is a 3.  PTL</td>', 'Too out of focus and I question if they are really candy canes.  Home made?  Maybe.  Sorry but all I can give is a 3.  PTL', '2002-12-24 00:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
