(177453, 9871, 4648, '<td valign="top">I see it is an upside down 4 and it is also an illusion.  Am I supposed to see anything else.  I''m not getting the title, unless it''s the cross, but that''s Easter.  The title really doesn''t matter in this challenge, "4", but since you did title it, I believe I must see it.  Other than not seeing the title, it''s probably too clear for me to see, the photo is technically a good B&amp;W.  Now you give me a problem as to how to score it.  I guess a 6 for the technical part of it.  PTL</td>', 'I see it is an upside down 4 and it is also an illusion.  Am I supposed to see anything else.  I''m not getting the title, unless it''s the cross, but that''s Easter.  The title really doesn''t matter in this challenge, "4", but since you did title it, I believe I must see it.  Other than not seeing the title, it''s probably too clear for me to see, the photo is technically a good B&W.  Now you give me a problem as to how to score it.  I guess a 6 for the technical part of it.  PTL', '2002-12-24 01:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(177454, 9992, 4648, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo.  I sure hope the radar sees the storm that appears to be coming.  But I have a great big question.  What are the two grey things sticking up from the bottom of the photo, on each side of the tower.  At first I thought it might be a tornadoe trying to form, then it looked like a finger mark on a negative.  Now I''m not too sure.  But it is really distracting.  I''d like to see further down to see what they are.  In fact on the left there are actually two of them connect about the second wrung up the tower.  I hate this because they knock the score down from a 10 to a 6.  And I really like how it looks like a storm coming.  PT&gt;</td>', 'Awesome photo.  I sure hope the radar sees the storm that appears to be coming.  But I have a great big question.  What are the two grey things sticking up from the bottom of the photo, on each side of the tower.  At first I thought it might be a tornadoe trying to form, then it looked like a finger mark on a negative.  Now I''m not too sure.  But it is really distracting.  I''d like to see further down to see what they are.  In fact on the left there are actually two of them connect about the second wrung up the tower.  I hate this because they knock the score down from a 10 to a 6.  And I really like how it looks like a storm coming.  PT>', '2002-12-24 01:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(177458, 10042, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great looking building with 4 great birds.  Beautiful sky and I love the contrast of the sun on the building with the shaded parts.  This is really good.  I know you cropped for the birds, but I would like to see what the whole building looks like.  Any way this deserves an 8.  PTL</td>', 'Great looking building with 4 great birds.  Beautiful sky and I love the contrast of the sun on the building with the shaded parts.  This is really good.  I know you cropped for the birds, but I would like to see what the whole building looks like.  Any way this deserves an 8.  PTL', '2002-12-24 01:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(177459, 9958, 4648, '<td valign="top">Come on now. No teasing.  The fur is beautiful.  I want to see the whole cat.  Is it a blue point?  I know the "4" paws, but they do have a cat attached.  For the paws you get a 7, where as the cat would have gotten a 9 or 10.  Sorry.  PTL</td>', 'Come on now. No teasing.  The fur is beautiful.  I want to see the whole cat.  Is it a blue point?  I know the "4" paws, but they do have a cat attached.  For the paws you get a 7, where as the cat would have gotten a 9 or 10.  Sorry.  PTL', '2002-12-24 01:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
