(177725, 9964, 2337, '<td valign="top">Very well composed shot with strong diagonals.  The grays are a bit muddy, which is a problem I always have when I shot Black &amp; White.  I wish I could tell you how to fix it.  Wonderful message and well executed.  Congrats on a great shot.</td>', 'Very well composed shot with strong diagonals.  The grays are a bit muddy, which is a problem I always have when I shot Black & White.  I wish I could tell you how to fix it.  Wonderful message and well executed.  Congrats on a great shot.', '2002-12-24 15:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(177726, 9866, 4815, '<td valign="top">OK so we have seen this technique become very popular in recent challenges. Yes I''ll give you 10 for technique. But for originality I am going to be a little nasty and knock off a few points. I am sure you had fun making this image. The colours and number arrangements are beautiful. Unfortunately I feel that too much of one thing like kraft dinner can lead to visual indigestion. This is just my little opinion. The other 100 DPC participants will give you a full 10 score. Photography is personal eye speaks. Keep up the good work.</td>', 'OK so we have seen this technique become very popular in recent challenges. Yes I''ll give you 10 for technique. But for originality I am going to be a little nasty and knock off a few points. I am sure you had fun making this image. The colours and number arrangements are beautiful. Unfortunately I feel that too much of one thing like kraft dinner can lead to visual indigestion. This is just my little opinion. The other 100 DPC participants will give you a full 10 score. Photography is personal eye speaks. Keep up the good work.', '2002-12-24 15:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
