(177865, 9924, 3747, '<td valign="top">Great color, a great crop, and an intersting subject. My only criticism would be to give it a better title. But, I give it a 9!</td>', 'Great color, a great crop, and an intersting subject. My only criticism would be to give it a better title. But, I give it a 9!', '2002-12-24 19:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
