(177876, 10031, 1379, '<td valign="top">I am simultaneously fascinated and horrified by the ridged, puckered texture of this food.  I guess I''ve been a vegetarian too long to appreciate the imprint of the intestinal casing.  Other than that, the photo is lovely, with the big lake of ketchup glistening in the background.  I like your lighting and choice of plate.</td>', 'I am simultaneously fascinated and horrified by the ridged, puckered texture of this food.  I guess I''ve been a vegetarian too long to appreciate the imprint of the intestinal casing.  Other than that, the photo is lovely, with the big lake of ketchup glistening in the background.  I like your lighting and choice of plate.', '2002-12-24 20:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(177879, 9866, 3419, '<td valign="top">This is a great concept - very creative. I would prefer the photo to be rotated 90 degrees clockwise. It''s amazing that you were able to get the three drops in the center in perfect alignment with each other.</td>', 'This is a great concept - very creative. I would prefer the photo to be rotated 90 degrees clockwise. It''s amazing that you were able to get the three drops in the center in perfect alignment with each other.', '2002-12-24 21:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
