(177912, 9940, 4494, '<td valign="top">I assume by "4x4" you mean the 4 trunks of the tree and the 4 barbed wires... Only problem is there''s 5 wires.  If you meant 4 SECTIONS defined by the 5 wires, it doesn''t work for me. :)  The wires aren''t "strong" enough to define the 4 areas.</td>', 'I assume by "4x4" you mean the 4 trunks of the tree and the 4 barbed wires... Only problem is there''s 5 wires.  If you meant 4 SECTIONS defined by the 5 wires, it doesn''t work for me. :)  The wires aren''t "strong" enough to define the 4 areas.', '2002-12-24 22:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
