(177995, 9856, 1686, '<td valign="top">The perspective is what makes this one of my favorites, though the grainy texture is distracting.</td>', 'The perspective is what makes this one of my favorites, though the grainy texture is distracting.', '2002-12-25 09:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
