(178046, 9929, 4055, '<td valign="top">My favourite this week. Everything is splendid: composition, colours, focus and border. Well done! Hope you win.</td>', 'My favourite this week. Everything is splendid: composition, colours, focus and border. Well done! Hope you win.', '2002-12-25 13:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
