(178299, 9937, 3575, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. I love the colorization on this shot.</td>', 'Very pretty. I love the colorization on this shot.', '2002-12-26 11:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(178301, 9990, 3575, '<td valign="top">Really nice colors. Would be better if the photo was rotated counter-clockwise so that the objects would be parallel with the border.</td>', 'Really nice colors. Would be better if the photo was rotated counter-clockwise so that the objects would be parallel with the border.', '2002-12-26 11:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(178303, 9902, 3294, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Great exposure.  The adults'' fingers crossed is hard to see.. but it''s what sells this photo.  Says more about the ''family'' than the ''baby''.  Nice job!</td>', 'Nice shot.  Great exposure.  The adults'' fingers crossed is hard to see.. but it''s what sells this photo.  Says more about the ''family'' than the ''baby''.  Nice job!', '2002-12-26 11:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(178304, 10056, 3294, '<td valign="top">Colors seem a little pale, but I think it''s accurate.  If only you coulda removed that cord int he water, huh?  heh</td>', 'Colors seem a little pale, but I think it''s accurate.  If only you coulda removed that cord int he water, huh?  heh', '2002-12-26 11:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(178305, 9946, 3575, '<td valign="top">Just a little more DOF so that all the writing on the spine could be read would really make the shot for me. Wonderful idea and color.</td>', 'Just a little more DOF so that all the writing on the spine could be read would really make the shot for me. Wonderful idea and color.', '2002-12-26 11:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(178306, 9948, 3575, '<td valign="top">I really like the way this is cropped so that the "family" fills up the whole frame. It''s very colorful and fun.</td>', 'I really like the way this is cropped so that the "family" fills up the whole frame. It''s very colorful and fun.', '2002-12-26 11:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(178308, 9999, 3294, '<td valign="top">I have to stretch my definition of ''four'' to say this photo meets the challenge.  It''s a nice shot but it seems a little forced.  I would have preferred this photo without the border.</td>', 'I have to stretch my definition of ''four'' to say this photo meets the challenge.  It''s a nice shot but it seems a little forced.  I would have preferred this photo without the border.', '2002-12-26 12:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(178309, 9847, 3575, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but very dark. I would like some light on the subject.</td>', 'Nice idea but very dark. I would like some light on the subject.', '2002-12-26 12:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(178310, 9929, 3575, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, Gorgeous!</td>', 'Ooooh, Gorgeous!', '2002-12-26 12:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(178311, 9966, 3294, '<td valign="top">White balance is off!!  haha, just kidding.  But why the club?  Isn''t the spade the strongest suit? What do I know?</td>', 'White balance is off!!  haha, just kidding.  But why the club?  Isn''t the spade the strongest suit? What do I know?', '2002-12-26 12:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
