(178450, 9857, 5058, '<td valign="top">Not bad at all, shame you could not leave the exp open a bit longer and get some definition on those kamp posts. Cool all the same though</td>', 'Not bad at all, shame you could not leave the exp open a bit longer and get some definition on those kamp posts. Cool all the same though', '2002-12-26 17:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
