(178511, 10050, 1280, '<td valign="top">I''ve been studying this.  Interesting expression, good bg, harsh,  but acceptable lighting on his face.  I don''t really see the connection to "Four" though.  Let me know if I''m missing something.</td>', 'I''ve been studying this.  Interesting expression, good bg, harsh,  but acceptable lighting on his face.  I don''t really see the connection to "Four" though.  Let me know if I''m missing something.', '2002-12-26 22:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
