(178796, 10065, 4648, '<td valign="top">This cropping adds nothing and takes away a lot, in my opinion.  White spots in center top of all 4 marbles distracting.  Shadows also distracting to me.  4 PTL</td>', 'This cropping adds nothing and takes away a lot, in my opinion.  White spots in center top of all 4 marbles distracting.  Shadows also distracting to me.  4 PTL', '2002-12-27 23:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(178797, 9856, 5684, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. The perspective, focus, lighting, and DOF are all great. But the noise is very distracting so I ended up giving an 8.</td>', 'I really like this photo. The perspective, focus, lighting, and DOF are all great. But the noise is very distracting so I ended up giving an 8.', '2002-12-27 23:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(178798, 9953, 4648, '<td valign="top">I see 5 points (4 technically, if you insist).  I do not like the red background.  It is a bit too much.  The "star" is very pretty but ruined by the background.  4 PTL</td>', 'I see 5 points (4 technically, if you insist).  I do not like the red background.  It is a bit too much.  The "star" is very pretty but ruined by the background.  4 PTL', '2002-12-27 23:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(178802, 9847, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonals here.  The grain on the table as well as the diagonals of the cards.  Definate depicts 4.  The angle and framing/cropping is good.  I would like to see some whites in here, maybe upping the contrast??  Otherwise a very nice shot for the challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the diagonals here.  The grain on the table as well as the diagonals of the cards.  Definate depicts 4.  The angle and framing/cropping is good.  I would like to see some whites in here, maybe upping the contrast??  Otherwise a very nice shot for the challenge.  Good luck.', '2002-12-27 23:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(178803, 10011, 4648, '<td valign="top">In this instance I feel all four should have been in focus.  Any reason in" 4 of a kind" for only 3 to be alike and the 4th different.  Even cards have 2 red and 2 black.  I don''t get your reasoning for 3 alike, not 4.  I like the angled placement but would have liked to have gone from lower left to upper right corners.  Again I don''t see your reasoning.  4 PTL</td>', 'In this instance I feel all four should have been in focus.  Any reason in" 4 of a kind" for only 3 to be alike and the 4th different.  Even cards have 2 red and 2 black.  I don''t get your reasoning for 3 alike, not 4.  I like the angled placement but would have liked to have gone from lower left to upper right corners.  Again I don''t see your reasoning.  4 PTL', '2002-12-27 23:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(178805, 9921, 4648, '<td valign="top">You realize we must assume the 4th card is there, as there is no sign of it.  The focus is good and the composition is good.  I like the dark background.  Crop is fine.  Frame doesn''t add or take away, to me.  6 PTL</td>', 'You realize we must assume the 4th card is there, as there is no sign of it.  The focus is good and the composition is good.  I like the dark background.  Crop is fine.  Frame doesn''t add or take away, to me.  6 PTL', '2002-12-27 23:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(178807, 9875, 3080, '<td valign="top">It''s really hard to tell that there are in fact 4 trees here.  I''ll take your word for it, but I don''t think that there is enough seperation of the trees to really see.  I like how the trees are droopy with snow.  Really pretty scene.  Either the focus is a tad soft, or it just looks that way cause of the snow.  I like the overall blue tint to the shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s really hard to tell that there are in fact 4 trees here.  I''ll take your word for it, but I don''t think that there is enough seperation of the trees to really see.  I like how the trees are droopy with snow.  Really pretty scene.  Either the focus is a tad soft, or it just looks that way cause of the snow.  I like the overall blue tint to the shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-27 23:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(178808, 9947, 4648, '<td valign="top">Much too dark to enjoy the beauty of the chess set and board.  Reflection is distracting.  Don''t like the landscape shot for this.  4 PTL</td>', 'Much too dark to enjoy the beauty of the chess set and board.  Reflection is distracting.  Don''t like the landscape shot for this.  4 PTL', '2002-12-27 23:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(178810, 10076, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the orangeness on this shot.  Quite too orange for my personal taste.  Otherwise though, it''s a great body part shot.  The angle and framing/cropping are good and the focus and clarity are ok as well.  The lighting down on the bottom/middle is a bit harsh on the blanket(?) it wipes the pattern out entirely in one spot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the orangeness on this shot.  Quite too orange for my personal taste.  Otherwise though, it''s a great body part shot.  The angle and framing/cropping are good and the focus and clarity are ok as well.  The lighting down on the bottom/middle is a bit harsh on the blanket(?) it wipes the pattern out entirely in one spot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-27 23:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(178811, 10033, 4648, '<td valign="top">Don''t like the color combination of beads you chose.  I know this is nitpicking but the beads on their side should be flat with the holes lining up straight out.  I do like the background color and the fading out.  Again don''t like this particular crop for this shot.  5 PTL</td>', 'Don''t like the color combination of beads you chose.  I know this is nitpicking but the beads on their side should be flat with the holes lining up straight out.  I do like the background color and the fading out.  Again don''t like this particular crop for this shot.  5 PTL', '2002-12-27 23:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(178812, 10026, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Love the angle.  Beautiful sky, just a little on the purple side, though.  Good focus, nice crop, good subject.  Nice composition and good execution.  7 PTL</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Love the angle.  Beautiful sky, just a little on the purple side, though.  Good focus, nice crop, good subject.  Nice composition and good execution.  7 PTL', '2002-12-27 23:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(178814, 9924, 4648, '<td valign="top">Would like to see more of the beautiful, ornate building.  Beautiful picture with beautiful colors and great focus and nice iterest.  BUT the angular, leaning shot ruins it.  Takes it from an 8, possible 9,  to a 5.  PTL</td>', 'Would like to see more of the beautiful, ornate building.  Beautiful picture with beautiful colors and great focus and nice iterest.  BUT the angular, leaning shot ruins it.  Takes it from an 8, possible 9,  to a 5.  PTL', '2002-12-27 23:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(178817, 10078, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2002-12-27 23:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(178818, 9985, 4648, '<td valign="top">Lighting need to be more uniform.  Too dark.  Good focus.  Seems cropped a little tight, especially on the bottom, left side very much so.  Nice composition, just need a little better execution.  6 PTL</td>', 'Lighting need to be more uniform.  Too dark.  Good focus.  Seems cropped a little tight, especially on the bottom, left side very much so.  Nice composition, just need a little better execution.  6 PTL', '2002-12-27 23:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(178819, 10055, 3080, '<td valign="top">Well, definately 4.  At first, I wasn''t fond of the focus, however, I see that it''s right on the 4, and for this challenge, it''s appropriate.  The scratches are a bit distracting to me. I realize it''s on old watch, but I think the scratches make the focus look even more off.  I guess the important part is that the 4 is clear, and it is.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Well, definately 4.  At first, I wasn''t fond of the focus, however, I see that it''s right on the 4, and for this challenge, it''s appropriate.  The scratches are a bit distracting to me. I realize it''s on old watch, but I think the scratches make the focus look even more off.  I guess the important part is that the 4 is clear, and it is.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-27 23:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(178821, 9892, 4648, '<td valign="top">Personally feel all 4 bottle should be turned to see name, or none at all.  Beautiful blue sky.  Like the angle of the shot.  Different.  Catches your eye.  7 PTL</td>', 'Personally feel all 4 bottle should be turned to see name, or none at all.  Beautiful blue sky.  Like the angle of the shot.  Different.  Catches your eye.  7 PTL', '2002-12-27 23:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(178822, 9866, 4648, '<td valign="top">Your going to get beat over the head about similar to 2 other challenge shots.  But I liked it then and still do.  I''ve read how it''s done and still can''t do it.  Good execution.  Must cut the score a little because it is just like 2 others, but is still a 7.  PTL</td>', 'Your going to get beat over the head about similar to 2 other challenge shots.  But I liked it then and still do.  I''ve read how it''s done and still can''t do it.  Good execution.  Must cut the score a little because it is just like 2 others, but is still a 7.  PTL', '2002-12-27 23:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(178823, 9879, 4648, '<td valign="top">Cute one.  And I happen to like humor.  Soft focus in places but not that bad.  A little busy.  But not bad.  6  PTL</td>', 'Cute one.  And I happen to like humor.  Soft focus in places but not that bad.  A little busy.  But not bad.  6  PTL', '2002-12-27 23:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
