(178826, 10034, 4648, '<td valign="top">Too bright.  Sky is blown out.  Actually hurts eyes.  Good focus and crop, and decent subject.  Just needs toned down some.  5 PTL</td>', 'Too bright.  Sky is blown out.  Actually hurts eyes.  Good focus and crop, and decent subject.  Just needs toned down some.  5 PTL', '2002-12-27 23:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(178828, 10078, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, pretty dining room.  Sun a little bright in places and dark in others.  Would have been very much improved if maybe had been set with 4 place settings.  The chair in the back actually looks like it is off center, maybe making room for a 5th chair (which I think I see the rungs of the back of.)  Forgive me if I''m wrong.  If the place settings had been their I would have missed that.  Sorry 5 PTL</td>', 'Nice shot, pretty dining room.  Sun a little bright in places and dark in others.  Would have been very much improved if maybe had been set with 4 place settings.  The chair in the back actually looks like it is off center, maybe making room for a 5th chair (which I think I see the rungs of the back of.)  Forgive me if I''m wrong.  If the place settings had been their I would have missed that.  Sorry 5 PTL', '2002-12-28 00:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(178829, 9889, 4648, '<td valign="top">Don''t like this at all.  Nice illusion.  Background needs to have been ironed smooth, can still see the fold creases and could have been a better color for this.  The shadows are very distracting, maybe should have back lit also.  Good focus but don''t like the cropping.  All I can give is a 4.  PTL</td>', 'Don''t like this at all.  Nice illusion.  Background needs to have been ironed smooth, can still see the fold creases and could have been a better color for this.  The shadows are very distracting, maybe should have back lit also.  Good focus but don''t like the cropping.  All I can give is a 4.  PTL', '2002-12-28 00:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(178830, 10049, 4648, '<td valign="top">4th bird and bottom totally out of focus.  Rest is good.  But can''t give above a 5.  PTL</td>', '4th bird and bottom totally out of focus.  Rest is good.  But can''t give above a 5.  PTL', '2002-12-28 00:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(178831, 9847, 4648, '<td valign="top">This one is different from the other cards.  Color would have been much better here.  Too dark and not sharp enough.  Cards appear to have been over sharpened, or wet.  Of all the card shots I like this one the best, though.  5 PTL</td>', 'This one is different from the other cards.  Color would have been much better here.  Too dark and not sharp enough.  Cards appear to have been over sharpened, or wet.  Of all the card shots I like this one the best, though.  5 PTL', '2002-12-28 00:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(178832, 9912, 4648, '<td valign="top">Love the color of the table.  It is beautiful wood.  The dominoes even take a pink tint from it.  The 4 tiles on their edge in the upper left corner add so much to this shot for me.  Makes it like it is a real game.  Same with the double 4 tile.  Good one.  Good subject, good focus, good crop, could be just a little lighter, but that''s not too bad.  Still an 8 as is.  PTL</td>', 'Love the color of the table.  It is beautiful wood.  The dominoes even take a pink tint from it.  The 4 tiles on their edge in the upper left corner add so much to this shot for me.  Makes it like it is a real game.  Same with the double 4 tile.  Good one.  Good subject, good focus, good crop, could be just a little lighter, but that''s not too bad.  Still an 8 as is.  PTL', '2002-12-28 00:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(178833, 10050, 4648, '<td valign="top">Blew his face out.  For me that ruined an otherwise great picture.  5 PTL</td>', 'Blew his face out.  For me that ruined an otherwise great picture.  5 PTL', '2002-12-28 00:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(178835, 10046, 4648, '<td valign="top">Very colorful and I like the red frame around it.  Good focus.  The paper they are laying on appears to have swirls of colors in it, I''m assuming picked up from the canes.  A neat touch, by accident I''m sure, but adds to it.  Nice 8  PTL</td>', 'Very colorful and I like the red frame around it.  Good focus.  The paper they are laying on appears to have swirls of colors in it, I''m assuming picked up from the canes.  A neat touch, by accident I''m sure, but adds to it.  Nice 8  PTL', '2002-12-28 00:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
