(178837, 9909, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice and bright, that''s for sure.  They appear to have a replection of something in the center of them that is distracting.  It over shadows their beauty of color.  If you could get rid of that, if you know what is causing it.  5 PTL</td>', 'Nice and bright, that''s for sure.  They appear to have a replection of something in the center of them that is distracting.  It over shadows their beauty of color.  If you could get rid of that, if you know what is causing it.  5 PTL', '2002-12-28 00:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
