(178990, 9862, 4648, '<td valign="top">Different crop.  White almost blown out, almost but not quite but still mighty bright.  Fairly good focus, the bright white makes it hard to really see.  Like where you caught, or set, the hands of the clock for the title.  Not real appealing but not too bad.  PTL 5</td>', 'Different crop.  White almost blown out, almost but not quite but still mighty bright.  Fairly good focus, the bright white makes it hard to really see.  Like where you caught, or set, the hands of the clock for the title.  Not real appealing but not too bad.  PTL 5', '2002-12-28 21:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(178994, 10060, 4648, '<td valign="top">I like the way you arranged the tape measure.  Much thought went into it. Keeps it from being just another shot of a measureing device.  Looks very good with the black background.  Very clear, and easy to read.  Good cropping.  Can''t see anything to really complain about or nitpick at.  Darn.  Guess you''ll get a 9.  PTL (doesn''t have "wow" for me for a 10.)</td>', 'I like the way you arranged the tape measure.  Much thought went into it. Keeps it from being just another shot of a measureing device.  Looks very good with the black background.  Very clear, and easy to read.  Good cropping.  Can''t see anything to really complain about or nitpick at.  Darn.  Guess you''ll get a 9.  PTL (doesn''t have "wow" for me for a 10.)', '2002-12-28 21:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(178996, 9971, 4648, '<td valign="top">Took some thought and time to do this.    Are you dragging it across the carpet?  I don''t see what you are dragging it with.  Good movement shot, good focus, good crop, good idea - guess 4 goods make a great 8.  PTL</td>', 'Took some thought and time to do this.    Are you dragging it across the carpet?  I don''t see what you are dragging it with.  Good movement shot, good focus, good crop, good idea - guess 4 goods make a great 8.  PTL', '2002-12-28 21:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(178997, 10045, 4648, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, any thing as beautiful as a rose should never, never be done in black and white.  Everything is right on in this photo and in color would be an 8 to a 10.  In black and white this is just a 4.  That''s how much a rose in black and white is plain flower.  Sorry, but that''s how I believe.  PTL</td>', 'In my opinion, any thing as beautiful as a rose should never, never be done in black and white.  Everything is right on in this photo and in color would be an 8 to a 10.  In black and white this is just a 4.  That''s how much a rose in black and white is plain flower.  Sorry, but that''s how I believe.  PTL', '2002-12-28 21:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(178998, 9917, 4648, '<td valign="top">Much, much, much too busy.  Don''t know what they are sitting on but get it out of there.  3PTL</td>', 'Much, much, much too busy.  Don''t know what they are sitting on but get it out of there.  3PTL', '2002-12-28 21:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(179001, 9938, 4648, '<td valign="top">It''s a good thing you took this when you did; it''s beginning to dry out.  I like that you took it right on the sidewalk, or whatever the concrete is.  Very good close-up.  We can see that it definitely a four-leafed clover and not a 3-leafed made into a 4.  Good job.  Very clean and clear.  Like the lighting very much, and the fact that''s there''s no harsh shine or brightness.  Good job.  PTL 8</td>', 'It''s a good thing you took this when you did; it''s beginning to dry out.  I like that you took it right on the sidewalk, or whatever the concrete is.  Very good close-up.  We can see that it definitely a four-leafed clover and not a 3-leafed made into a 4.  Good job.  Very clean and clear.  Like the lighting very much, and the fact that''s there''s no harsh shine or brightness.  Good job.  PTL 8', '2002-12-28 21:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(179002, 9986, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful setting.  Great imagination.  Beautiful glasses.  Hmmmm, they''re hummingbirds.  Wonder if that means anything.  I wonder.  My only complaint, and I really hate to say this because it''s my favorite color, but the background is almost too dark for the bottle.  Either a lighter shade of blue, or a lighter bottle.  The beautiful bottle gets lost in the background, and the bottle in itself is beautiful.  This knocked you down from a 10 to an awesome 8.  PTL</td>', 'Beautiful setting.  Great imagination.  Beautiful glasses.  Hmmmm, they''re hummingbirds.  Wonder if that means anything.  I wonder.  My only complaint, and I really hate to say this because it''s my favorite color, but the background is almost too dark for the bottle.  Either a lighter shade of blue, or a lighter bottle.  The beautiful bottle gets lost in the background, and the bottle in itself is beautiful.  This knocked you down from a 10 to an awesome 8.  PTL', '2002-12-28 21:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(179003, 10027, 4648, '<td valign="top">Now this is strange.  I know you are going to tell us how you did this.  This will sure catch your eye.  I don''t particularly like it as photos go but it sure is different.  PTL 7</td>', 'Now this is strange.  I know you are going to tell us how you did this.  This will sure catch your eye.  I don''t particularly like it as photos go but it sure is different.  PTL 7', '2002-12-28 21:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(179005, 9884, 4648, '<td valign="top">I just now got this and it''s saturday night at 9:44.  You reall put thought into this.  I refused to say "I don''t understand what I''m looking at".  8 divided by 2 = 4, 4 divided by 1 = 4, 12 divided by 3 = 4.  PTL  40 divided by 4 = 10.</td>', 'I just now got this and it''s saturday night at 9:44.  You reall put thought into this.  I refused to say "I don''t understand what I''m looking at".  8 divided by 2 = 4, 4 divided by 1 = 4, 12 divided by 3 = 4.  PTL  40 divided by 4 = 10.', '2002-12-28 21:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(179006, 9855, 4648, '<td valign="top">You lose - 3 ducks and 1 swan.  You missed on the technical part of photography.  Do like hou you made it look like a pond.  cute idea, worth a 5.  Not in real good focus.  3 ducks and 1 swan do not 4 ducks make.  PTL</td>', 'You lose - 3 ducks and 1 swan.  You missed on the technical part of photography.  Do like hou you made it look like a pond.  cute idea, worth a 5.  Not in real good focus.  3 ducks and 1 swan do not 4 ducks make.  PTL', '2002-12-28 21:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(179007, 10053, 4648, '<td valign="top">Unique.  You were glad when they said we could add borders, weren''t you.  This is sure different.   And I like it.  Good choice of colors also.  Nice job.  PTL 6</td>', 'Unique.  You were glad when they said we could add borders, weren''t you.  This is sure different.   And I like it.  Good choice of colors also.  Nice job.  PTL 6', '2002-12-28 21:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(179009, 9961, 4494, '<td valign="top">There are FIVE balls in the picture, not four. :)</td>', 'There are FIVE balls in the picture, not four. :)', '2002-12-28 21:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(179010, 9970, 4648, '<td valign="top">You didn''t have to cut the 5th leaf out.  I see the 4 in the middle. (Are they pistols or stemens)  It''s been way too many years since school.  Beautiful flower and photo.  I think the background is exactly the color you needed to enhance the flower.  I really would have liked it better if it had all of the flower in.  Just my thoughts.  Still an 8. PTL</td>', 'You didn''t have to cut the 5th leaf out.  I see the 4 in the middle. (Are they pistols or stemens)  It''s been way too many years since school.  Beautiful flower and photo.  I think the background is exactly the color you needed to enhance the flower.  I really would have liked it better if it had all of the flower in.  Just my thoughts.  Still an 8. PTL', '2002-12-28 21:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(179011, 10059, 4494, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool image, but what does it mean?  How did you get this effect?</td>', 'Pretty cool image, but what does it mean?  How did you get this effect?', '2002-12-28 21:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(179014, 9992, 4494, '<td valign="top">I usually don''t like these kinds of pics, but I DO LIKE this one! :)  The only destracting is the blurred sticks(?) in the middle and on the right.</td>', 'I usually don''t like these kinds of pics, but I DO LIKE this one! :)  The only destracting is the blurred sticks(?) in the middle and on the right.', '2002-12-28 21:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(179015, 9865, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is the highest I have rated a card photo.  And that''s because you hve some color and something other than the cards.  Of all the card ones yours is the very best.  And I give this a 7.  PTL</td>', 'This is the highest I have rated a card photo.  And that''s because you hve some color and something other than the cards.  Of all the card ones yours is the very best.  And I give this a 7.  PTL', '2002-12-28 21:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(179017, 10010, 4494, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t send a good message...  No paridise at all. :)</td>', 'Doesn''t send a good message...  No paridise at all. :)', '2002-12-28 22:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(179019, 9952, 4648, '<td valign="top">The background is distracting from these beautiful flowers.  You can see to much detail in the background.  I would have cropped it out all together.  Also something appears to be wrapping around the flowers and is distracting.  This could be a beautiful photo with a little work.  PTL 5</td>', 'The background is distracting from these beautiful flowers.  You can see to much detail in the background.  I would have cropped it out all together.  Also something appears to be wrapping around the flowers and is distracting.  This could be a beautiful photo with a little work.  PTL 5', '2002-12-28 22:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(179020, 10052, 4648, '<td valign="top">No!  No!.  Don''t crop out part of these beautiful flowers.  Even if you have to do it for size.  I would have left the border off.  These are beautiful flowers and colors and you have cut them off.  Now I must cut off some of your score.  PTL 6</td>', 'No!  No!.  Don''t crop out part of these beautiful flowers.  Even if you have to do it for size.  I would have left the border off.  These are beautiful flowers and colors and you have cut them off.  Now I must cut off some of your score.  PTL 6', '2002-12-28 22:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(179022, 9850, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''ve left this one to last because it is so cute.  Looks like you tried to get the pen to work on your hand.  You didn''t get it covered up with the thumb.  Either that or you have a spider on your hand.  You are an artist.  I personally would have cropped off just before the hand so it would look like 4 eople standing up.  Nice focus, Ilike it soft like this.  Black background good for this.  B&amp;W good choice here.  This is not a 10 as photos go, and you didn''t expect it either, but it is a good strong 7.  I really like it.  PTL</td>', 'I''ve left this one to last because it is so cute.  Looks like you tried to get the pen to work on your hand.  You didn''t get it covered up with the thumb.  Either that or you have a spider on your hand.  You are an artist.  I personally would have cropped off just before the hand so it would look like 4 eople standing up.  Nice focus, Ilike it soft like this.  Black background good for this.  B&W good choice here.  This is not a 10 as photos go, and you didn''t expect it either, but it is a good strong 7.  I really like it.  PTL', '2002-12-28 22:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(179039, 10045, 3018, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is my favorite picture of the week.  Looks great in B&amp;W.  Lighting, contrasts and focus are excellent. Good luck!</td>', 'Wow! This is my favorite picture of the week.  Looks great in B&W.  Lighting, contrasts and focus are excellent. Good luck!', '2002-12-28 23:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(179040, 10033, 3018, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture. Color tonalities are great, as is the composition.  The background is excellent.  Seems a little soft.</td>', 'I really like this picture. Color tonalities are great, as is the composition.  The background is excellent.  Seems a little soft.', '2002-12-28 23:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(179045, 10043, 5822, '<td valign="top">Nice vibrant colors!</td>', 'Nice vibrant colors!', '2002-12-29 00:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(179047, 10030, 5822, '<td valign="top">Good sense of  humor.</td>', 'Good sense of  humor.', '2002-12-29 00:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(179050, 9904, 5822, '<td valign="top">Sobering shot...good DOF and I like the colors of the flag against the white of the snow.</td>', 'Sobering shot...good DOF and I like the colors of the flag against the white of the snow.', '2002-12-29 00:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(179052, 9832, 5822, '<td valign="top">Candle light appears a bit harsh, but I like the colors.</td>', 'Candle light appears a bit harsh, but I like the colors.', '2002-12-29 00:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(179053, 9887, 5822, '<td valign="top">Definitely like the layout of the feathers, as well as, the way you captured the texture of them too.  It almost feels like you''re looking up at a building</td>', 'Definitely like the layout of the feathers, as well as, the way you captured the texture of them too.  It almost feels like you''re looking up at a building', '2002-12-29 00:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(179054, 9912, 5822, '<td valign="top">Too much cherry in the furniture, but I like the concept.</td>', 'Too much cherry in the furniture, but I like the concept.', '2002-12-29 00:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(179057, 10021, 5822, '<td valign="top">Love the openess and airiness of the photo. And the grass looks like a carpet. Well done! Just don'' t like the title cause I dont think it has anything to do with the photo.</td>', 'Love the openess and airiness of the photo. And the grass looks like a carpet. Well done! Just don'' t like the title cause I dont think it has anything to do with the photo.', '2002-12-29 00:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(179059, 10033, 5822, '<td valign="top">love the colors, as well as the background.</td>', 'love the colors, as well as the background.', '2002-12-29 01:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(179060, 9963, 2217, '<td valign="top">Hey, this is a good picture.  I love the bare branches contrasting with the red of the building.  Its also nice a clear and the focus is good.</td>', 'Hey, this is a good picture.  I love the bare branches contrasting with the red of the building.  Its also nice a clear and the focus is good.', '2002-12-29 01:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(179062, 9902, 5822, '<td valign="top">Excellent tonal range and contrast. Love the detail. Wonderful family shot.</td>', 'Excellent tonal range and contrast. Love the detail. Wonderful family shot.', '2002-12-29 01:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(179065, 9986, 5822, '<td valign="top">You must work for an advertising agency...very well done. Excellent layout and love the way the background and foreground colors interact in the 4 glasses.</td>', 'You must work for an advertising agency...very well done. Excellent layout and love the way the background and foreground colors interact in the 4 glasses.', '2002-12-29 01:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(179083, 10055, 3586, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2002-12-29 04:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(179085, 10022, 3586, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2002-12-29 05:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(179086, 10027, 3586, '<td valign="top">great photo</td>', 'great photo', '2002-12-29 05:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(179087, 9970, 3586, '<td valign="top">very nice sharp it is 7</td>', 'very nice sharp it is 7', '2002-12-29 05:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(179090, 10000, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great job here. I like the arrangement of the shadows here and the effect it has here to suggest squinting eyes. You can almost see the person behind them.  How''d you get such straight diagnols without any jaggies?</td>', 'Great job here. I like the arrangement of the shadows here and the effect it has here to suggest squinting eyes. You can almost see the person behind them.  How''d you get such straight diagnols without any jaggies?', '2002-12-29 06:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(179092, 10050, 5822, '<td valign="top">Not sure I get how this fits the challenge.</td>', 'Not sure I get how this fits the challenge.', '2002-12-29 06:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(179095, 10076, 5158, '<td valign="top">Like it very much: well choosen coposition (and clean feets) great color and setting of light. Thumb up, it''s one of my favorits!</td>', 'Like it very much: well choosen coposition (and clean feets) great color and setting of light. Thumb up, it''s one of my favorits!', '2002-12-29 07:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(179096, 10045, 5158, '<td valign="top">Awesome setting of light!! Great composition and B&amp;W works great.<br/>Although I''m sure this shot would be as perfect in color too. <br/>Thumb up, one of my few favorits!</td>', 'Awesome setting of light!! Great composition and B&W works great.Although I''m sure this shot would be as perfect in color too. Thumb up, one of my few favorits!', '2002-12-29 07:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(179097, 10023, 5158, '<td valign="top">That''s a good one: great humor without only relying on it to work. <br/>It''s well composed, the color is well chosen. Only the reflections from forehead disturb a little.<br/></td>', 'That''s a good one: great humor without only relying on it to work. It''s well composed, the color is well chosen. Only the reflections from forehead disturb a little.', '2002-12-29 08:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(179099, 9954, 5158, '<td valign="top">A great piece of photographical art! The composition, light, topic are all well chosen. If I were you, I would make a series of these kind of pictures and put them as big as possible onto the wall!</td>', 'A great piece of photographical art! The composition, light, topic are all well chosen. If I were you, I would make a series of these kind of pictures and put them as big as possible onto the wall!', '2002-12-29 08:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(179100, 9987, 5158, '<td valign="top">I very much like the way you set the light! Also a great idea. Only that the interior in the romm can slightly be seen disturbes a bit. Still one of my favorits.</td>', 'I very much like the way you set the light! Also a great idea. Only that the interior in the romm can slightly be seen disturbes a bit. Still one of my favorits.', '2002-12-29 08:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(179101, 9879, 5158, '<td valign="top">LOL: that''s a keeper and should be placed on everyone''s fridge. Like the composition too. Could be less bright in my opinion though.</td>', 'LOL: that''s a keeper and should be placed on everyone''s fridge. Like the composition too. Could be less bright in my opinion though.', '2002-12-29 08:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(179102, 9985, 5158, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull idea, composition and setting of the light. I would not have crropped it so tight on the left side to better keep the symmetry</td>', 'Wonderfull idea, composition and setting of the light. I would not have crropped it so tight on the left side to better keep the symmetry', '2002-12-29 08:13:37.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(179103, 9990, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great idea, also like that they are placed on the fabric. The soft light (or their dim surface) makes them appear a little flat though.</td>', 'Great idea, also like that they are placed on the fabric. The soft light (or their dim surface) makes them appear a little flat though.', '2002-12-29 08:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(179104, 9944, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great idea to let four marbles fall into the water simultaneously. Light and cropping could have been better though. But getting this picture down was probably pretty hard and therefore thumb up!</td>', 'Great idea to let four marbles fall into the water simultaneously. Light and cropping could have been better though. But getting this picture down was probably pretty hard and therefore thumb up!', '2002-12-29 08:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(179112, 10027, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. my favorite picture of the challenge. Simple and to the point. 4 stars!!</td>', 'Very interesting. my favorite picture of the challenge. Simple and to the point. 4 stars!!', '2002-12-29 09:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(179113, 9846, 3306, '<td valign="top">What a refreshing picture. The colors are wonderful. definitely one of the top 3.</td>', 'What a refreshing picture. The colors are wonderful. definitely one of the top 3.', '2002-12-29 09:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(179114, 10053, 3306, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I love the contrast. One of my top 3 picks for this week.</td>', 'Great shot. I love the contrast. One of my top 3 picks for this week.', '2002-12-29 09:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(179115, 9889, 3306, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an interesting picture! Please tell us how you did it.</td>', 'Wow, what an interesting picture! Please tell us how you did it.', '2002-12-29 09:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(179116, 10050, 3306, '<td valign="top">Really nice picture, but I''m not sure where the 4 comes in?</td>', 'Really nice picture, but I''m not sure where the 4 comes in?', '2002-12-29 09:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(179117, 10010, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good use of color to set the mood of a disturbing picture. Could have been a little more in focus, especially on the powder in the backround.</td>', 'Good use of color to set the mood of a disturbing picture. Could have been a little more in focus, especially on the powder in the backround.', '2002-12-29 09:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(179132, 10076, 332, '<td valign="top">Would be better in BW. Good idea though.</td>', 'Would be better in BW. Good idea though.', '2002-12-29 11:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(179133, 9924, 3724, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the angle of view which you have presented.....  colours are excellent in the architectural detal and play of shadow is subtile......   very nice.<br/></td>', 'I enjoy the angle of view which you have presented.....  colours are excellent in the architectural detal and play of shadow is subtile......   very nice.', '2002-12-29 11:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(179134, 10045, 332, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Shot! One of my favorites this week. (arnit)</td>', 'Beautiful Shot! One of my favorites this week. (arnit)', '2002-12-29 11:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(179135, 9879, 2716, '<td valign="top">Yessir, you won''t live long,. but you''ll have a good life.  :)</td>', 'Yessir, you won''t live long,. but you''ll have a good life.  :)', '2002-12-29 11:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(179156, 9929, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool shot!  Sure hope you do a tutorial on it. Your choice of a border color was genius.  Can''t think of anything else to say except 10.</td>', 'This is such a cool shot!  Sure hope you do a tutorial on it. Your choice of a border color was genius.  Can''t think of anything else to say except 10.', '2002-12-29 12:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(179157, 9970, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love, love, love this shot.  The only thing that I would "nitpick" about it is that I would like to see the white of the flower "pop" a little more.   But still a 10 for me.</td>', 'Love, love, love this shot.  The only thing that I would "nitpick" about it is that I would like to see the white of the flower "pop" a little more.   But still a 10 for me.', '2002-12-29 12:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(179158, 9835, 2553, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color, it looks almost like a painting.</td>', 'Beautiful color, it looks almost like a painting.', '2002-12-29 12:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(179159, 10036, 2553, '<td valign="top">A little dark maybe, but nevertheless, I like it a lot.</td>', 'A little dark maybe, but nevertheless, I like it a lot.', '2002-12-29 12:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(179160, 9943, 2553, '<td valign="top">Amazing how something so simple can be so visually effective.  Cool concept, and beautiful color.</td>', 'Amazing how something so simple can be so visually effective.  Cool concept, and beautiful color.', '2002-12-29 12:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(179161, 9947, 2553, '<td valign="top">What really makes this shot appealing to me is the reflections on the game pieces.  I think I would have liked to have seen even more reflections, especially on the top of the "horse" piece.</td>', 'What really makes this shot appealing to me is the reflections on the game pieces.  I think I would have liked to have seen even more reflections, especially on the top of the "horse" piece.', '2002-12-29 12:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(179162, 10027, 4969, '<td valign="top">Imediately I say 10 and we have a winner! I have only looked at 60 shots!Excellent photo! I''m looking again and just noticed the 4''s on the left are not "funnelling" in? Was that intentional?</td>', 'Imediately I say 10 and we have a winner! I have only looked at 60 shots!Excellent photo! I''m looking again and just noticed the 4''s on the left are not "funnelling" in? Was that intentional?', '2002-12-29 13:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(179163, 9856, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love this shot so much.  Not only that it is black and white, which I am crazy about, but the unusual perspective; and that it seems to convey a tactile, emotional connection to the music.</td>', 'I love this shot so much.  Not only that it is black and white, which I am crazy about, but the unusual perspective; and that it seems to convey a tactile, emotional connection to the music.', '2002-12-29 13:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(179172, 9913, 5070, '<td valign="top">would hv been better to use a tripod... great concept, though</td>', 'would hv been better to use a tripod... great concept, though', '2002-12-29 13:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(179173, 9838, 5070, '<td valign="top">interesting idea...</td>', 'interesting idea...', '2002-12-29 13:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
