(179200, 10050, 4767, '<td valign="top">Great Pic, but not too obviously a propos of the challenge.  Takes it from a higher number to a ... 4.</td>', 'Great Pic, but not too obviously a propos of the challenge.  Takes it from a higher number to a ... 4.', '2002-12-29 14:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(179201, 9877, 4767, '<td valign="top">And you just neet a four to make 21?  Maybe the bet should have been $4 as well...  I like it - a non-obvious four!  I rate it two 4s - 8!</td>', 'And you just neet a four to make 21?  Maybe the bet should have been $4 as well...  I like it - a non-obvious four!  I rate it two 4s - 8!', '2002-12-29 14:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(179206, 9865, 4411, '<td valign="top">Excellent work.<br/>The focus &amp; detail on the cards is spot on, the DoF on the chips is perfect and the composition couldn''t be better. My favourite shot this week.</td>', 'Excellent work.The focus & detail on the cards is spot on, the DoF on the chips is perfect and the composition couldn''t be better. My favourite shot this week.', '2002-12-29 16:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(179207, 9924, 332, '<td valign="top">Good composition. (arnit)</td>', 'Good composition. (arnit)', '2002-12-29 16:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(179208, 9990, 4411, '<td valign="top">Nice simple, straightforward shot. Focus &amp; composition are good. Lighting is maybe a bit too straight-on, some more shadows on the pieces would have livened them up a bit. Great idea to use denim as a background, makes a nice change from black. Well done.</td>', 'Nice simple, straightforward shot. Focus & composition are good. Lighting is maybe a bit too straight-on, some more shadows on the pieces would have livened them up a bit. Great idea to use denim as a background, makes a nice change from black. Well done.', '2002-12-29 16:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(179209, 9985, 4411, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, a very artistic looking meal. The lighting is beautiful as is the composition.<br/>I would probably have cropped a little lower at the top, through the corner of the mat to keep the image balanced.<br/>Still worthy of a 9. Well done.</td>', 'Nice shot, a very artistic looking meal. The lighting is beautiful as is the composition.I would probably have cropped a little lower at the top, through the corner of the mat to keep the image balanced.Still worthy of a 9. Well done.', '2002-12-29 16:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(179210, 9946, 4411, '<td valign="top">Great use of colour and fantastic composition. Would have liked a *touch* more DoF to get all the text in focus, but the blurred out background is great.<br/>The border doesn''t match the image for me, in fact it''s distracting and takes away rather than adds to the overall effect. Otherwise nice work.</td>', 'Great use of colour and fantastic composition. Would have liked a *touch* more DoF to get all the text in focus, but the blurred out background is great.The border doesn''t match the image for me, in fact it''s distracting and takes away rather than adds to the overall effect. Otherwise nice work.', '2002-12-29 16:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(179211, 10065, 4411, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Love the colours, the lighting and the composition on this one. Well done.</td>', 'Excellent. Love the colours, the lighting and the composition on this one. Well done.', '2002-12-29 16:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(179212, 9846, 4411, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. The water droplets, colours, background, composition &amp; lighting are all great. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice shot. The water droplets, colours, background, composition & lighting are all great. Well done.', '2002-12-29 16:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(179214, 10064, 5884, '<td valign="top">I would have put more pieces on the board. Where were you trying to focus?</td>', 'I would have put more pieces on the board. Where were you trying to focus?', '2002-12-29 16:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
