(179223, 10031, 4648, '<td valign="top">Not enough focus.  At least the 4 bites should be in focus to show your subject.  That''s alright, I don''t like hot dogs anyway.  1/4 focus = 2.5 or 3.  PTL</td>', 'Not enough focus.  At least the 4 bites should be in focus to show your subject.  That''s alright, I don''t like hot dogs anyway.  1/4 focus = 2.5 or 3.  PTL', '2002-12-29 17:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(179224, 9856, 4648, '<td valign="top">Looks like a beautiful guitar.  I would like to have seen it in color.  A little dark.  Focus a little soft.  Cropping tight.  Dispite all this not too bad.  5 PTL</td>', 'Looks like a beautiful guitar.  I would like to have seen it in color.  A little dark.  Focus a little soft.  Cropping tight.  Dispite all this not too bad.  5 PTL', '2002-12-29 17:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(179226, 9878, 4648, '<td valign="top">Too dark and has no appeal to me what so ever.  Mirror image doesn''t work here, in my opinion, and it''s all that is in focus.  Sorry.  PTL 4</td>', 'Too dark and has no appeal to me what so ever.  Mirror image doesn''t work here, in my opinion, and it''s all that is in focus.  Sorry.  PTL 4', '2002-12-29 17:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(179227, 9990, 4648, '<td valign="top">Not sure I can figure this out.  The colored pieces appear to have a very soft focus, but the material they are on appears very sharp.  That, to me, is strange.  Good color.  Not a lot of interest, but met the challenge.  A bit dark.  Don''t like the background fading out to total black on this one.  But not too bad over all.  PTL 5</td>', 'Not sure I can figure this out.  The colored pieces appear to have a very soft focus, but the material they are on appears very sharp.  That, to me, is strange.  Good color.  Not a lot of interest, but met the challenge.  A bit dark.  Don''t like the background fading out to total black on this one.  But not too bad over all.  PTL 5', '2002-12-29 17:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(179228, 9832, 4648, '<td valign="top">That''s 4 bright lights.  From the thumbnail I was set to give it a 3 or 4, BUT...now it calls for more.  The focus is good, the colors nice, the composition good, execution nice.  What I like the most is how the light goes down into the candles a little.  What I like least is  hmmmmm.  Nothing to really dislike.  Not a 10 but a good solid 8.  PTL</td>', 'That''s 4 bright lights.  From the thumbnail I was set to give it a 3 or 4, BUT...now it calls for more.  The focus is good, the colors nice, the composition good, execution nice.  What I like the most is how the light goes down into the candles a little.  What I like least is  hmmmmm.  Nothing to really dislike.  Not a 10 but a good solid 8.  PTL', '2002-12-29 17:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(179229, 9847, 3607, '<td valign="top">a little dark . . .</td>', 'a little dark . . .', '2002-12-29 17:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(179230, 9943, 3607, '<td valign="top">nice colors</td>', 'nice colors', '2002-12-29 17:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(179231, 10002, 4648, '<td valign="top">Just a little hard to see the bubbles on the dark red background.  Nitpicking - the background needs to be smoothed out.  It''s these nasty details that count.  We don''t see them on our photos but we sure do on others.  Really over all not bad.  Nice 6 PTL</td>', 'Just a little hard to see the bubbles on the dark red background.  Nitpicking - the background needs to be smoothed out.  It''s these nasty details that count.  We don''t see them on our photos but we sure do on others.  Really over all not bad.  Nice 6 PTL', '2002-12-29 17:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
