(179238, 10048, 3607, '<td valign="top">nice use of a mirror.  i like how you can hardly see the black die.</td>', 'nice use of a mirror.  i like how you can hardly see the black die.', '2002-12-29 17:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(179239, 9954, 3607, '<td valign="top">took me a second. . .</td>', 'took me a second. . .', '2002-12-29 17:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(179240, 10043, 4648, '<td valign="top">I like the framing of this very much.  The colors are good.  The focus is real nice, can see the texture of the fruit.  My only real complaint is I''ve cleaned and cleaned my screen and still can''t get rid of whatever is below the lime.  It immediately caught my eyes.  Other wise this is a nich photo.  An 8 is great.  PTL</td>', 'I like the framing of this very much.  The colors are good.  The focus is real nice, can see the texture of the fruit.  My only real complaint is I''ve cleaned and cleaned my screen and still can''t get rid of whatever is below the lime.  It immediately caught my eyes.  Other wise this is a nich photo.  An 8 is great.  PTL', '2002-12-29 17:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(179241, 9925, 3607, '<td valign="top">how many takes did this take?</td>', 'how many takes did this take?', '2002-12-29 17:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(179242, 10055, 3607, '<td valign="top">nice detail and DOF</td>', 'nice detail and DOF', '2002-12-29 17:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(179243, 10056, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I know how to comment on this.  What ever is on the base in front of the "Four" is distracting.  The blue is even more distracting and even fights for your eyes, as maybe trying to be the subject.  Focus is exceptional and can see the texture of the items. Like the color combinations.  But something just isn''t right about this shot.  Maybe crop out the dark blue or put a different background all together.  Another light source might get rid of the shadow.  Hate to score so low on such a nicely focused shot.  But 3 is all I can go.  PTL</td>', 'I''m not sure I know how to comment on this.  What ever is on the base in front of the "Four" is distracting.  The blue is even more distracting and even fights for your eyes, as maybe trying to be the subject.  Focus is exceptional and can see the texture of the items. Like the color combinations.  But something just isn''t right about this shot.  Maybe crop out the dark blue or put a different background all together.  Another light source might get rid of the shadow.  Hate to score so low on such a nicely focused shot.  But 3 is all I can go.  PTL', '2002-12-29 17:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(179244, 10025, 3607, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2002-12-29 17:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(179245, 9979, 3607, '<td valign="top">i think you could have done this so that the sheet would have ''disapeared'' and the photo would have been much more powerful.</td>', 'i think you could have done this so that the sheet would have ''disapeared'' and the photo would have been much more powerful.', '2002-12-29 17:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(179246, 9937, 4648, '<td valign="top">First of all, Christmas balls are to be colorful, so why do it in sepia?  Secondly "4" being the challenge, I feel all 4 should be in focus.  Thirdly, the cropping is way to tight for me.  Just look cramed together.  Nitpicking, I don''t like "X"mas.  PTL</td>', 'First of all, Christmas balls are to be colorful, so why do it in sepia?  Secondly "4" being the challenge, I feel all 4 should be in focus.  Thirdly, the cropping is way to tight for me.  Just look cramed together.  Nitpicking, I don''t like "X"mas.  PTL', '2002-12-29 17:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(179247, 10043, 3607, '<td valign="top">i think you could have adjusted the photo to make the black background ''disapear'' . . .</td>', 'i think you could have adjusted the photo to make the black background ''disapear'' . . .', '2002-12-29 18:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(179248, 10023, 4648, '<td valign="top">In natural color the "lips" would have shown up so much better!  Any particular reason for your color selection?  Other wise, this is a great shot.  Good focus, nice cropping, nice composition.  Just needs better execution.  Have to shave for the color.  I feel it is very important here.  Still a 7.  PTL</td>', 'In natural color the "lips" would have shown up so much better!  Any particular reason for your color selection?  Other wise, this is a great shot.  Good focus, nice cropping, nice composition.  Just needs better execution.  Have to shave for the color.  I feel it is very important here.  Still a 7.  PTL', '2002-12-29 18:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(179249, 9836, 3607, '<td valign="top">fantastic 4!</td>', 'fantastic 4!', '2002-12-29 18:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(179250, 10053, 3607, '<td valign="top">beautifully done!</td>', 'beautifully done!', '2002-12-29 18:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(179251, 10074, 4648, '<td valign="top">I hope the color swatches are on a piece of paper that you laid the candy on.  For me the bright white background is a little too much.  Don''t know that the border helped a lot here.  PTL 5</td>', 'I hope the color swatches are on a piece of paper that you laid the candy on.  For me the bright white background is a little too much.  Don''t know that the border helped a lot here.  PTL 5', '2002-12-29 18:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(179252, 10036, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice trick.  Who would have thought of a way to make this different.  (Of course you do know there are more than 4 colors in the rainbow).  Just a little dark and I guess you couldn''t get rid of the shadows.  Don''t think the border helped you any here, but didn''t hurt either.  Not bad.  7 PTL</td>', 'Nice trick.  Who would have thought of a way to make this different.  (Of course you do know there are more than 4 colors in the rainbow).  Just a little dark and I guess you couldn''t get rid of the shadows.  Don''t think the border helped you any here, but didn''t hurt either.  Not bad.  7 PTL', '2002-12-29 18:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(179253, 9868, 4648, '<td valign="top">Again I say....all 4 should have been in focus because the challenge is "4".  By having 1 in focus it appears "1" is the challenge.  Too dark and not enough differentiation in the end of the table and background.  If they are to be different they should be different.  Sorry but 3 is all I can give.  PTL</td>', 'Again I say....all 4 should have been in focus because the challenge is "4".  By having 1 in focus it appears "1" is the challenge.  Too dark and not enough differentiation in the end of the table and background.  If they are to be different they should be different.  Sorry but 3 is all I can give.  PTL', '2002-12-29 18:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(179258, 10083, 5070, '<td valign="top">this would be more interesting with more of the bottom portion cropped away</td>', 'this would be more interesting with more of the bottom portion cropped away', '2002-12-29 18:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(179261, 10025, 1115, '<td valign="top">ugly foot</td>', 'ugly foot', '2002-12-29 19:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(179273, 9948, 4648, '<td valign="top">Cropped to tightly.  Looks crowded.  If this were a portrait you wouldn''t crop it this closely.  And it is just that, of a family.  Good focus, true colors for these dolls.  PTL 5</td>', 'Cropped to tightly.  Looks crowded.  If this were a portrait you wouldn''t crop it this closely.  And it is just that, of a family.  Good focus, true colors for these dolls.  PTL 5', '2002-12-29 20:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(179276, 9887, 4648, '<td valign="top">Too dark for me.  Just doesn''t have that apeal that grabs you or brings you back again.  Nice crop and fine focus.  PTL 4</td>', 'Too dark for me.  Just doesn''t have that apeal that grabs you or brings you back again.  Nice crop and fine focus.  PTL 4', '2002-12-29 20:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(179277, 10047, 4648, '<td valign="top">FOCUS!</td>', 'FOCUS!', '2002-12-29 20:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(179279, 9916, 4648, '<td valign="top">There are some places on the top left corner of the wall that are distracting.  Would hve looked better if candles had been lit.  Too dark.  The shine of the candle sticks doesn''t come thru because of the darkness.  Candles should have been same length, so they would slant at same line with the candle sticks.  Maybe this sounds like nitpicking, but it is the kind of attention you need to give to details.  This makes a big difference in a regular photo and an outstanding photo.  PTL 4</td>', 'There are some places on the top left corner of the wall that are distracting.  Would hve looked better if candles had been lit.  Too dark.  The shine of the candle sticks doesn''t come thru because of the darkness.  Candles should have been same length, so they would slant at same line with the candle sticks.  Maybe this sounds like nitpicking, but it is the kind of attention you need to give to details.  This makes a big difference in a regular photo and an outstanding photo.  PTL 4', '2002-12-29 20:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(179280, 9978, 4648, '<td valign="top">background too busy as well as the reflections on the lens are not clear and are therefore, just busyness.  The glasses do not stand out so you can see them clearly.  They''re just kind of in there amoung the other stuff.  PTL 4</td>', 'background too busy as well as the reflections on the lens are not clear and are therefore, just busyness.  The glasses do not stand out so you can see them clearly.  They''re just kind of in there amoung the other stuff.  PTL 4', '2002-12-29 20:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(179282, 9979, 4648, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s just my eyes, but the egg cup on the left appears to be leaning.  I like the way you placed the eggs in the tray and the tray in the photo.  Good composition like this.  This is paying attention to detail, for those that don''t understand.  Am I leaning or is that egg cup?  Good soft focus.  Nice background.  Black works well here.  Nice cropping.  Fairly good photo.  Worth a 7. PTL</td>', 'Maybe it''s just my eyes, but the egg cup on the left appears to be leaning.  I like the way you placed the eggs in the tray and the tray in the photo.  Good composition like this.  This is paying attention to detail, for those that don''t understand.  Am I leaning or is that egg cup?  Good soft focus.  Nice background.  Black works well here.  Nice cropping.  Fairly good photo.  Worth a 7. PTL', '2002-12-29 20:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(179285, 10006, 4648, '<td valign="top">Maybe this is nitpicking, but is there a reason for 3 to be alike and 1 to be different?  That leads me to think it''s a different challenge.  Either all four should be different, or all should be alike.   When you look at a photo you look to see what is there.  Here immediately you say, 3 alike and 1 different.  When you should say 4 hats.  The focus is fine.  The cropping is good.  The composition is nice.  Just can''t deal with 3 and 1.  Sorry.  PTL 6</td>', 'Maybe this is nitpicking, but is there a reason for 3 to be alike and 1 to be different?  That leads me to think it''s a different challenge.  Either all four should be different, or all should be alike.   When you look at a photo you look to see what is there.  Here immediately you say, 3 alike and 1 different.  When you should say 4 hats.  The focus is fine.  The cropping is good.  The composition is nice.  Just can''t deal with 3 and 1.  Sorry.  PTL 6', '2002-12-29 20:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(179286, 9891, 5825, '<td valign="top">i''m not sure how well this illustrates the concept of four, but it is an interesting view of the food ordering experience :)</td>', 'i''m not sure how well this illustrates the concept of four, but it is an interesting view of the food ordering experience :)', '2002-12-29 20:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
