(179288, 9857, 5825, '<td valign="top">very interesting horizon, i like the effect.  seems to be a photograph more about that than the theme of "4", though.</td>', 'very interesting horizon, i like the effect.  seems to be a photograph more about that than the theme of "4", though.', '2002-12-29 20:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
