(179290, 10046, 5825, '<td valign="top">nice holiday spirit, interesting colors... but the fact that there are 4 colors is a big plus :)</td>', 'nice holiday spirit, interesting colors... but the fact that there are 4 colors is a big plus :)', '2002-12-29 20:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(179291, 10052, 5825, '<td valign="top">very pretty, interesting lighting effects.</td>', 'very pretty, interesting lighting effects.', '2002-12-29 20:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(179292, 9910, 4648, '<td valign="top">Accidental or intentional that there appears to be a diamon on top of each shadow?  I like it.  It adds that something different.  Very appealing photo.  Nothing fancy, just technically good photography with nice colors, composition, and execution.  Not a "wow" but I like it.  PTL 8</td>', 'Accidental or intentional that there appears to be a diamon on top of each shadow?  I like it.  It adds that something different.  Very appealing photo.  Nothing fancy, just technically good photography with nice colors, composition, and execution.  Not a "wow" but I like it.  PTL 8', '2002-12-29 20:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(179293, 9895, 4648, '<td valign="top">Too tightly cropped for me.  Makes it appear cramped.  In my opinion either spread it out and zoom out some; or just have 4 oranges and the 4 ball.  The focus is good and the light is good.  I would also have it all in focus so the 4 ball would be an emphasis to the 4 oranges, to emphasize the brand of your title.  Still a decent shot.  PTL 6</td>', 'Too tightly cropped for me.  Makes it appear cramped.  In my opinion either spread it out and zoom out some; or just have 4 oranges and the 4 ball.  The focus is good and the light is good.  I would also have it all in focus so the 4 ball would be an emphasis to the 4 oranges, to emphasize the brand of your title.  Still a decent shot.  PTL 6', '2002-12-29 20:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
