(179566, 9987, 3942, '<td valign="top">As I can read in the comments some of you didn''t see the connection with "4". Was it really so hard to realise it? I did hope, that the viewer is able to see the number 4 in her crossed legs. I tried to accentuate it by using only back light and a darker model in the foreground. But maybe it was not clearly enough. <br/> <br/>Nevertheless thanks a lot for all your comments, esp. to those voters, who took the time for looking a little bit longer on my shot to get the connection with the challenge.<br/>Happy new year and keep on shooting!</td>', 'As I can read in the comments some of you didn''t see the connection with "4". Was it really so hard to realise it? I did hope, that the viewer is able to see the number 4 in her crossed legs. I tried to accentuate it by using only back light and a darker model in the foreground. But maybe it was not clearly enough.  Nevertheless thanks a lot for all your comments, esp. to those voters, who took the time for looking a little bit longer on my shot to get the connection with the challenge.Happy new year and keep on shooting!', '2002-12-30 05:37:20.000000', NULL, 0),
