(179671, 10053, 3575, '<td valign="top">Thank you! I''m very pleased. This is a great way to end the year, I must say. <br/> <br/>I have had a question about the background. It is a piece of yellow poster board that was cut and glued onto the white poster board. I used a rotary cutter to get the smooth curves. <br/> <br/>Thanks again everybody!</td>', 'Thank you! I''m very pleased. This is a great way to end the year, I must say.  I have had a question about the background. It is a piece of yellow poster board that was cut and glued onto the white poster board. I used a rotary cutter to get the smooth curves.  Thanks again everybody!', '2002-12-30 11:06:58.000000', NULL, 0),
