(179698, 9998, 5750, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your responses guys. This is very helpful as it is my first submission. I only joined dpchallenge on the day of this competition so it was all a bit rushed and once i''d taken the picture (in fine mode) and read the instructions about size I realised I needed to shrink down the file size which ended up making it so small.<br/> <br/>I was thinking of chopping off the top half of this photo and wished I had in the end.<br/> <br/>PS. Special thanks for your response jmetzler as I had looked at all your photos and am very impressed with your work so I was very happy when you gave feedback.</td>', 'Thanks for your responses guys. This is very helpful as it is my first submission. I only joined dpchallenge on the day of this competition so it was all a bit rushed and once i''d taken the picture (in fine mode) and read the instructions about size I realised I needed to shrink down the file size which ended up making it so small. I was thinking of chopping off the top half of this photo and wished I had in the end. PS. Special thanks for your response jmetzler as I had looked at all your photos and am very impressed with your work so I was very happy when you gave feedback.', '2002-12-30 11:51:10.000000', NULL, 0),
