(179862, 10027, 2716, '<td valign="top">Dang!  No purty ribbon.  Hee hee.  I''ll take a fourth place (my second) any day.  I think they should hand out fourth place ribbons.  Actually, up to seventh place ribbons (had two of those) would be nice.  Maybe they should hand out ribbons for pictures that never had a chance in hell, like my submission for this week.  OK, Jacko needs coffee and go back to work.<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the nice comments everyone!</td>', 'Dang!  No purty ribbon.  Hee hee.  I''ll take a fourth place (my second) any day.  I think they should hand out fourth place ribbons.  Actually, up to seventh place ribbons (had two of those) would be nice.  Maybe they should hand out ribbons for pictures that never had a chance in hell, like my submission for this week.  OK, Jacko needs coffee and go back to work. Thanks for all the nice comments everyone!', '2002-12-30 15:39:32.000000', NULL, 0),
